    <string name="settings_bg_desc">Chesi ndiyo mandharinyuma pekee inayoonyesha uwazi, na kwenye kionyeshi cha picha uwazi ni habari, si urembo.</string>
    <string name="settings_ui_theme">Mandhari</string>
    <string name="settings_ui_theme_desc">Kama programu yenyewe iwe nyepesi au nyeusi. Ni tofauti na mandharinyuma ya picha hapo chini: chesi ipo kuonyesha uwazi, si kulingana na rangi.</string>
